    narr:narration """The requirement for a [signed release manifest](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for all Meridian deployments was established on August 9, 2026, by Quinton Fairweather. The gate is framed as a [direct response](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2) to a specific security failure—the arrival of two unsigned artifacts in staging during the previous quarter—which serves as the primary justification for the new mandate. The [scope of the requirement](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) is explicitly defined to cover both staging and production environments, formalizing the [decision](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) as a core component of the deployment pipeline. While the mandate is presented as a singular, authoritative [administrative record](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5), it ties the current operational constraint directly to the past incident, positioning the gate as a conservation-focused measure to ensure artifact integrity.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Every Meridian deployment now requires a signed release\nmanifest before it ships." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We saw two unsigned artifacts reach staging\nlast quarter and that is the whole reason for the gate." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Scope**: applies to staging and production" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The mandate is presented as a necessary reaction to a past failure, potentially limiting its scope to the specific incident described." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:writer "google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite" .
